{"id":"n14675-1-12","stage":4,"title":"가시다 · 消退","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14675-1-12-1","ko":"목마르지? 이 음료수 마셔.","zh":"渴了吗？喝点这个饮料吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"목마르지?","meaning":"口渴","explanation":"목마르다：口渴；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"목마르다","audio":"/audio/9e9d0b9fcf45589e75fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55860","senseId":"1","lemma":"목마르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목마르지","audio":"/audio/f4949a3ee02ee1a3b967.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"음료수","meaning":"饮料","explanation":"음료수：饮料。","readings":[{"term":"음료수","audio":"/audio/aaae4e60029f5d1be170.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71113","senseId":"2","lemma":"음료수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음료수","audio":"/audio/aaae4e60029f5d1be170.mp3"}},{"text":"마셔.","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마셔","audio":"/audio/b94af85d4e3b100cdd33.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9e9d0b9fcf45589e","term":"목마르다","zh":"口渴","audio":"/audio/9e9d0b9fcf45589e75fe.mp3","entryId":"55860","definition":"很想喝水。","pronunciation":["몽마르다"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"aaae4e60029f5d1b","term":"음료수","zh":"饮料","audio":"/audio/aaae4e60029f5d1be170.mp3","entryId":"71113","definition":"为了缓解口渴或因为好喝而喝的液体。","pronunciation":["음ː뇨수"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d",